# AICL Example: Prime Check
# AX sub-language — compiles to real code.

Goal:
Is prime

Layer:
Core

Behavior Check
    Input: n
    Output: result
    Action:
        if n < 2:
            return false
        i = 2
        while i * i <= n:
            if n % i == 0:
                return false
            i = i + 1
        return true
